
## 📁 Project Structure

- INFIX/ - Infix expression parsing and conversion to postfix notation
  - checking.c - Operator checking functions
  - convert.c - Conversion from infix to postfix
  - convert.h - Header file for infix conversion
  - infix.h - Header file for infix operations
- POSTFIX/ - Postfix expression evaluation and calculation
  - calculate.c - Arithmetic calculations for postfix expressions
  - evaluate.c - Evaluation of postfix expressions
  - evaluate.h - Header file for postfix evaluation
  - postfix.h - Header file for postfix operations
- commands.h - Command definitions and opcode mappings
- func.h - Data structures for CPU state and memory management
- main.c - Main program entry point
- slc.h - Header file with function declarations
- Makefile - Build configuration

## 📖 SIMPLE Language Syntax

The SIMPLE language supports:
- Variables (single letter names)
- Arithmetic expressions with +, -, *, / operators
- Conditional statements (IF/THEN)
- Loops and jumps
- Input/output operations
- Comments (REM command)

